{
  "what": "The graph-floor / anchor-seed interaction fix, measured. An anchor-derived graph activation used to trip the per-scope graph-weight floor for a candidate that had none, moving up to a quarter of the weight off the bm25/vector evidence carrying it -- so the anchor demoted the node it was seeding (result.md section 6). The floor is unchanged; the anchor walk is now separate from the pre-anchor walk and every candidate an anchor touches is also scored the way it would have been scored with anchors off, keeping the better of the two.",
